  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Merces huius locationis est duodecim denarii Pisanorum per annum, quos Matteus filius Aldobrandini Salvio filio Rustici in festo Sancti Martini singulis annis persolvere tenetur.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si locator vel conductor contra pactum huius locationis venire praesumpserit, poenam viginti solidorum denariorum Senensium componat et locatio ad terminum suum usque firma permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Forteguerra de Forteguerriis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Guidottus filius Iacobi</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ardingus de Pannocchieschis</name>
